# Declension: en.wiktionary.org, entry “सदी” (feminine ī-stem: सदी / सदियाँ / सदियों).  A noun counted by a
# numeral stands in the OBLIQUE case, so the oblique forms are unit
# surfaces in their own right.
# शताब्दी and शती are the Sanskritic doublets en.wiktionary lists as its
# synonyms, both feminine ī-stems taking the same endings.
सदी
सदियाँ
सदियों
शताब्दी
शताब्दियाँ
शताब्दियों
शती
